# Files that belong in the repository but not on the website.
#
# Everything here was being served publicly: the unpublished blog drafts in
# content/, the SEO and Google Business Profile notes in docs/, and the build
# tooling. The published site is the HTML, the Markdown mirrors, the assets,
# and the serverless function — nothing else.
#
# Deployment is unaffected: Vercel runs no build step, so nothing here is
# needed at deploy time. package.json is deliberately NOT listed — Vercel
# already keeps it out of the served output, and it declares the Node version
# for the api/ function. Verify after deploying that these return 404.

content/
docs/
tools/

README.md
SETUP.md
